* VCO core of tt_um_vco_adc: V-to-I + bias mirror + 7-stage current-starved ring
* Ports: vin, vs = M1 source (to the bias resistor in rarray), ph0..ph6 ring phases
.subckt csinv in out vbp vbn vdd gnd
XMph x   vbp vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=1 L=1
XMpi out in  x   vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=1.0 L=0.15
XMni out in  y   gnd sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=0.5 L=0.15
XMnf y   vbn gnd gnd sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=0.5 L=1
XMc  gnd out gnd gnd sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=1.4 L=2.86
.ends

.subckt vco_core vin vs ph0 ph1 ph2 ph3 ph4 ph5 ph6 vdd gnd
XM1  vbp vin vs  gnd sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=4 L=1
XMpd vbp vbp vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=1 L=1
XMp2 vbn vbp vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=1 L=1
XMnd vbn vbn gnd gnd sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=0.5 L=1
X0 ph6 ph0 vbp vbn vdd gnd csinv
X1 ph0 ph1 vbp vbn vdd gnd csinv
X2 ph1 ph2 vbp vbn vdd gnd csinv
X3 ph2 ph3 vbp vbn vdd gnd csinv
X4 ph3 ph4 vbp vbn vdd gnd csinv
X5 ph4 ph5 vbp vbn vdd gnd csinv
X6 ph5 ph6 vbp vbn vdd gnd csinv
.ends

* Bias resistors of both halves: one xhigh-poly array, strips D N1 P1 P2 N2 D
* (common centroid). Each half: two strips in series from vs to gnd.
.subckt rarray vsp vsn gnd
XRP2 vsp mp gnd sky130_fd_pr__res_xhigh_po_0p35 L=20
XRP1 mp gnd gnd sky130_fd_pr__res_xhigh_po_0p35 L=20
XRN1 vsn mn gnd sky130_fd_pr__res_xhigh_po_0p35 L=20
XRN2 mn gnd gnd sky130_fd_pr__res_xhigh_po_0p35 L=20
XRD0 gnd gnd gnd sky130_fd_pr__res_xhigh_po_0p35 L=20
XRD5 gnd gnd gnd sky130_fd_pr__res_xhigh_po_0p35 L=20
.ends
